<title>USA: Wang gets Defense Department contract.</title>
<headline>Wang gets Defense Department contract.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wang Laboratories Inc said Wednesday it had received a U.S. Defense Department contract with a maximum value of $30 million over five years.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Wang and I-NET Inc, a company it recently acquired, will design the communications infrastructure, and implement and support the telecommunications networks to interconnect training and operational locations for military exercises in the Pacific region.</p>
</text>
